h3xdOS live system, built on Arch Linux.

Wired networks with DHCP connect on their own. For Wi-Fi use nmtui
(or iwctl), for mobile broadband (WWAN) modems use mmcli.

Ubuntu and Kali with apt run in containers: h3xdos-box ubuntu or
h3xdos-box kali (the first start downloads the image).

LightDM logs user h3x into Xfce automatically. Text consoles on
Ctrl+Alt+F2 to F6 accept root without a password.

The console keyboard is US. For Czech run: loadkeys cz-us-qwertz
Pause then locks US on or off, AltGr switches for a single key.

